# Test Cases (EXCP Time)

All `*-test-cases.md` files for this product live in **this TestCases repo**:

- `test-cases/<feature>/frontend/*.md`
- `test-cases/<feature>/backend/*.md`

Format: `o:/Company work/Company projects/ExcpTime/Testing-feature/docs/standards/test-case-format.md`

Run the status CLI from this repo root:

```bash
tc project doctor
tc t "test-cases/<feature>/<layer>/<file>.md"
tc s <KEY> ok
tc next "test-cases/<feature>/<layer>/<file>.md"
```

Use stable `Key` values (prefix `EXCP`) for status updates, not `TC-01` alone.

When linked app repos change behavior, update matching `*-test-cases.md` here in the same task.

**No file yet?** Create the spec under `test-cases/<feature>/<layer>/` in the same task — never skip test-case authoring because the folder or file is missing.

**Auto-impact:** With `autoImpact` in `testing-feature.project.json` (default), succeeded keys linked via **Related code** are set to **`needs-update`** automatically — no manual `tc impact` after each edit. Run `tc project sync` once to install the workspace Cursor stop hook.
